 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 544593,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "There are six members on the board of a Parent Teacher Association (PTA) at a local elementary school: the president (P), the vice president (V), the recording secretary (R), the liaison to the administration (L), the treasurer (T), and the chief fundraiser (C). The board must decide which equipment to purchase for the classrooms with moneys from their annual fundraisers. The preferences of the board members are shown in the table below.<br>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th><b>P</b></th>\n<th><b>V</b></th>\n<th><b>R</b></th>\n<th><b>L</b></th>\n<th><b>T</b></th>\n<th><b>C</b></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Option A</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option B</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option C</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option D</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<br>The board uses plurality method and a runoff in the event of a tie, such that the option(s) with the least votes will be eliminated in each round. Which option will be chosen?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Step 1: Determine the number of votes necessary to have a majority. There are six members, so 50 percent of 6 is 0.5(6) = 3. A majority is at least one more than 50 percent, which is 4 or more votes.</p>\n<p>Step 2: In the first round, A and B have 2 votes. C and D have 1 vote. No one has the majority. C and D tie for the least number of votes, so eliminate them both.</p>\n<p>Step 3: Reorder the votes with the remaining options.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>&nbsp;</th>\n<th><b>P</b></th>\n<th><b>V</b></th>\n<th><b>R</b></th>\n<th><b>L</b></th>\n<th><b>T</b></th>\n<th><b>V</b></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Option A</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option B</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Option B now has 4 votes, which wins the majority.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Option B."
    }
   ],
